<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fingerhut said restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fingerhut said restarted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns restarted coverage of Fingerhut Cos Inc as neutral, a Bear Stearns source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 11-1/2 Wednesday.</p>
</text>
